;s:10:"Your order";s:10:"best_match";s:10:"Best match";s:13:"exchange_cost";s:23:"This exchange will cost";s:7:"buy_res";s:9:"Buy {res}";s:8:"sell_res";s:10:"Sell {res}";s:13:"no_own_offers";s:33:"You have no offers in the market.";s:9:"i_receive";s:9:"I receive";s:8:"i_search";s:8:"I search";s:8:"quantity";s:8:"Quantity";s:6:"action";s:6:"Action";s:6:"cancel";s:6:"Cancel";s:11:"your_offers";s:11:"Your offers";s:17:"no_other_villages";s:17:"No other villages";s:21:"premium_exchange_info";a:10:{s:5:"title";s:32:"Welcome to the Premium Exchange!";s:5:"intro";s:78:"Use the Premium Exchange to trade premium points for resources and vice versa.";s:14:"capacity_title";s:29:"Capacity and stock for trades";s:13:"capacity_body";s:330:"There is a Premium Exchange for each continent. Each with its own capacity, indicating the amount of resources it can have. The current capacity and stock will determine the exchange ratio. Resources will be exchanged at lower levels when it is full to the point of not accepting more. When emptied it will not be able to provide.";s:13:"request_title";s:14:"Make a request";s:12:"request_body";s:111:"You can make your trades in \"buy\" and \"sell\" and see an estimate of their value based on the current ratio.";s:14:"exchange_title";s:16:"Make an exchange";s:13:"exchange_body";s:449:"When placing an order, the market will suggest an exchange with approximate values for the nearest premium point. Upon accepting the offer, resources will be transferred between you and the market. Selling resources will require merchants to transport the resources. While buying will use the Market merchants. In both cases the waiting time will be 2:00:00. Please note that Premium Points obtained this way cannot be transferred to other accounts.";s:10:"fees_title";s:15:"Fees and growth";s:9:"fees_body";s:207:"When buying resources from the market a small part is automatically set aside to increase the storage capacity of the resource. Every day, Exchanges in adjacent