e flag from your inventory, and click Apply.";s:7:"village";s:7:"Village";s:15:"active_flag_col";s:11:"Active Flag";s:9:"bonus_col";s:5:"Bonus";s:18:"select_flag_option";s:17:"-- Select Flag --";s:5:"avail";s:6:"avail.";s:5:"apply";s:5:"Apply";s:6:"remove";s:6:"Remove";s:17:"no_villages_found";s:18:"No villages found!";s:16:"error_tribe_only";s:36:"Feature restricted to tribe members.";s:21:"error_same_tribe_only";s:46:"You can only trade with members of your tribe.";s:23:"help_resource_wood_name";s:19:"Resource production";s:23:"help_resource_wood_desc";s:96:"Place the resource flag between your workers and watch how resource production efficiency grows.";s:21:"help_recruitment_name";s:17:"Recruitment speed";s:21:"help_recruitment_desc";s:186:"The training of new troops can be accelerated by hoisting the recruitment speed flag in your village, as a reminder to everyone that their efficiency is not only expected, but necessary.";s:16:"help_attack_name";s:15:"Attack strength";s:16:"help_attack_desc";s:173:"Inspired by the flag they know is flying in their village, the troops from a village with the attack flag will fight even more fiercely for what their ruler demands of them.";s:17:"help_defense_name";s:16:"Defense strength";s:17:"help_defense_desc";s:69:"Gather your troops with the defense flag and strengthen your defense.";s:14:"help_luck_name";s:4:"Luck";s:14:"help_luck_desc";s:260:"Luck flags allow their holders to predict the outcome of their attacks by manipulating the "luck" factor. These mysterious flags will force luck to work in your favor. If a battle has -20% or +20% luck, a 6% flag would force luck to -14% and +14% respectively.";s:20:"help_population_name";s:19:"Population capacity";s:20:"help_population_desc";s:120:"Encourages the population to maximize housing and allows to expand your village further by hoisting the Population flag.";s:19:"help_coin_cost_name";s:16:"Lower coin costs";s:19:"help_coin_cost_desc";s:73:"Press the nobility to reduce their service fees by raising the coin flag.";s:15:"help_cargo_name";s:13:"Haul capacity";s:15:"help_cargo_desc";s:99:"Grant your soldiers the strength and endurance they need to bring greater loot with the cargo flag.";}s:12:"info_command";a:11:{s:5:"title";s:5:"Order";s:6:"target";s:12:"Destination:";s:8:"duration";s:9:"Duration:";s:7:"arrival";s:8:"Arrival:";s:10:"arrival_in";s:11:"Arrival in:";s:6:"origin";s:7:"Origin:";s:11:"rally_point";s:11:"Rally point";s:11:"send_troops";s:11:"Send troops";s:6:"player";s:7:"Player:";s:4:"loot";s:4:"Loot";s:10:"no_command";s:26:"The command does not exist";}}